Bind Npc 24420 Zone 11

On greeting
    If quest 317 is started and player has 910130000
        Say "I am Mungus, the fourth [Alternate of Suffering]! You have the [Third Certificate of Suffering] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
        Topic "Accepted" do
            Say "What is the name of an expansive prairie war zone which is one of the primary sites of Lunar War?"
            Topic "Nirdth Triangle" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910130000
                    Give 1 of 910131000
            Topic "Alseids Plateau" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910130000
                    Say "Your answer is incorrect. Your [Third Certificate of Suffering] has been consumed as penalty. It is time for me to leave now."
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    Else if quest 317 is started
        Say "I am Mungus, the fourth [Alternate of Suffering]!I only pose the question to those who bring the [Third Certificate of Suffering]."
    Else
        Say ""
